@@ -15,3 +15,14 @@ The application will now be running on `http://localhost:11224`.
 - **[React](https://react.dev/)**: Used for UI components.
 - **[Tailwind CSS](https://tailwindcss.com/)**: For styling the application.
 - **[Astro DB](https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/database/)**: Powers the comments feature, using a libSQL-compatible database.
+
+## Phone verification at sign-up
+
+The sign-up form (`src/components/SignUpForm.tsx`) verifies the user's mobile number with a 6-digit one-time passcode before the account is created:
+
+1. `POST /api/otp/send` normalises the number to E.164, stores a salted hash of a fresh code in the session (5-minute expiry, 5 attempts, 30-second resend cooldown) and delivers it over SMS.
+2. `POST /api/otp/verify` checks the submitted code; on success the verified number is recorded in the session and the client calls the registration endpoint.
+
+The SMS body ends with the WebOTP origin-bound line (`@your-host #123456`), so Chrome on Android fills the code in automatically via `navigator.credentials.get({ otp: ... })`. Other browsers get the code suggested on the keyboard through `autocomplete="one-time-code"`.
+
+Copy `.env.example` to `.env` and add Twilio credentials to send real messages. Without them, the code is logged to the server console.
